  "question": {
    "text": "In basic medium, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> exhibits which of the following reactions?<br />(A) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><br />(B) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math><br />(C) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PbS</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math><br />Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "(A),(C) only",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "(A) only",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "(B) only",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "(A), (B) only",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In basic medium, oxidising action of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math></p><p>In basic medium, reducing action of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>In acidic medium, oxidising action of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PbS</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>PbSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Hence correct option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>"
  }
